  "whyItMatters": "private/ is the sprint's source inventory and the source hierarchy names it first. A lane that searches it with plain `find` sees ZERO files and concludes honestly that a source is not in custody. Three New Mexico families and one Washington family are SOURCE_BLOCKED on sources that were here the whole time.",
